    "duplicate_family_key": "btc-daily-obv-ma-long-cash-2-18-24-30",
    "prior_result_status": "NO_MATCHED_CAPITAL_RESULT_FOUND_FOR_EXACT_STANDALONE_POLICY",
    "distinct_from_closed_families": [
      "The closed DRA directional-volume-participation filter used within-day positive-return volume share and retained DRA execution; this policy uses cumulative signed complete-day volume and standalone full-capital long/cash timing.",
      "The open forward volume-confirmation family uses unsigned total daily volume relative to a prior twenty-day median as a DRA admission diagnostic; it does not use OBV accumulation or an OBV moving-average state.",
      "The closed price-only trend and breakout policies do not condition on participation flow and can disagree with the OBV state.",
      "The closed intraday-volume concentration, H1 volume-weighted close-location, Amihud and search-attention families use different features, parents and causal mechanisms."
    ],
    "excluded_reinterpretations": [
      "Two versus twenty-four complete days is the primary tuple. Two versus eighteen and two versus thirty are rejection-only neighbors and cannot replace a failed primary.",
      "No alternate short or slow length, EMA, volume field, sign convention, band, delay, minimum hold, price filter, cash yield, leverage, short leg, DRA interaction or ensemble may be scanned after outcome access.",
      "A historical pass remains REPORTED_NOT_ACTIVATED and requires at most one independent sealed OOS."
    ]
